    "body": "## What and why\n\nIndependent quarter-grid rounding destroyed the protection of #2101's continuous joint direction. This adds an opt-in, fixed residual-feedback constructor and a strictly authenticated saved-credit import, so that formation can be tested without repeating 411 backwards. It changes no serving rule or native acceptance condition.\n\n## Result\n\nThe fixed original-parent development experiment produced **32 rounds, 28 distinct legal displacements, zero eligible displacements and zero native proposal scores/commits**. Every displacement predicts objective descent but violates 52–218 protected first-order constraints. Independent 391-state native reload retains original **5/15 conditional winners, 17/17 references, 380/380 guards and CE 5.111520730202647**. Accepted **8/512** and the separate prior **9/15** candidate remain unchanged. No actual-nine/full512/fresh/multi-turn evaluation was run after negative construction.\n\n**KEEP** the tested implementation/import and negative evidence; **REJECT** the candidate, model **NOT YET PROMOTED**. This is not observed native winner loss or a global discrete-feasibility result. Two pre-construction setup failures are preserved, with narrow journal-accounting and declared-path-relocation repairs. No new backwards, training graph forwards, GPU or paid compute.\n\nThe next justified task is saved formation attribution, not another radius/pass/seed sweep. Exact executed source/binary/config/report/manifest identities, all 32 compact round receipts, and the independent saved-arithmetic review are in the dated record. Full evidence is retained via cloud-store, 624,674,304 bytes, MD5 fcc6b2a621e7668e5bf8dc08ad490b08; upload/download round-trip verification passed and its receipt is posted.\n\n## Exact-head validation and review\n\nAt `a374c06d51fc178e50df94a4ed792efc668623ed` (latest-main merge retained both concurrent current-state entries; model source unchanged):\n- `cargo test --offline --release -p uor-r4-training --example geometric-frozen-map-fit coupled_episode_learning -- --test-threads=2`: **42 passed, 0 failed**.\n- Optimized offline production example build: **PASS**. `UOR_BUILD_SOURCE_COMMIT` remains the measured `7381d670735acddb0fac1f7abc0d83498aed04fc`; all 24 executed example/module Rust files are unchanged at delivery head. Later commits add records/reviews or merge unrelated main work.\n- Scoped rustfmt for all six changed Rust files and `git diff --check`: **PASS**. Repository-wide fmt has a pre-existing unrelated `native_geometric/relation_compiler.rs` difference; it is not represented as passing.\n- Claim wording: **PASS**. Geometry connections: **29/29 PASS**; all 15 SVGs regenerated.\n- Completed normative report seal verification: **PASS**. Independent saved arithmetic recomputes every displacement, objective dot and normalized protected residual exactly; it checks 391 saved identities and producer reload flags without another model/full-pool replay.\n- Independent source reviews cover the quantizer, native integration and both narrow repairs. Exact-head self-review confirms their reviewed Rust blobs, scoped claims, prospective policy and unchanged native gates.\n\n## Checklist\n\n- [x] Checks run at this exact head (above)\n- [x] Dated record: `docs/labs/protected-discrete-feedback-2026-10-09/README.md`\n- [x] Newest current-state entry ending in **Next:**\n- [x] Stale-doc search and affected training README, README, geometry section/figure updated; historical records retained\n- [x] STATUS / ROADMAP / #2028 table checked: accepted artifact and milestone state unchanged\n- [x] README updated in existing Training section\n- [x] Claim-wording check passes\n- [x] After merge: verify fresh main, report result, delete branch/worktree, preserve evidence and run hygiene\n\nReferences #2030. References #2028.\n\nDelivery verified: merge `1a4ae709ca6fbc988d30be6ca6bcefd2bafb2d2e` on fresh main, all20 delivered blobs matched. GitHub/local branch and owned worktree deleted; about4.55GB owned local files removed after verified preservation. Hygiene apply completed with own local-results scope; peers preserved, busy uv cache skipped. Complete elapsed through cleanup: 85.32 minutes, charged to the shared ledger; constructor263.138s, no GPU/paid compute.\n",
